  "Nodes": {
    "entry-00000": {
      "Id": "entry-00000",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "GSI does not usually hire freelancers for field extermination. We prefer data, samples, and controlled recovery teams. But what came across my desk was... not something I intend to send interns after.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A maintenance relay in an abandoned station outside the Nar Shaddaa lanes began transmitting again. At first we assumed squatters or scavengers. Then we received fragmented logs. Torn bulkheads. Missing crews. Heat signatures too large for any known pest species aboard station infrastructure. ",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Then came the last report. One of the station's old survey archives referenced a transported specimen of Arkanian origin, classified, never properly logged into Republic channels. Large. Aggressive. Extremely resilient.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Yes. Which is precisely why this report is disturbing. Something that size should not have survived transport, confinement, or decades of neglect. Yet the station logs suggest it adapted. The interior is now a sealed hunting ground. Power flickers. Life support is unstable. Several lower decks have been reduced to wreckage. Whatever is in there has made the station its nest.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Board the abandoned station. Confirm the report. Kill the beast. Then bring back proof so I can close this file with something more useful than rumor and bloodstains.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Good. Enter the station, put the creature down, and recover proof of the kill. Return here afterward. And one more thing-if you find any surviving logs intact, leave them. I care more about the dragon being dead than I do about how it learned to thrive in there.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": []
    },
    "entry-00006": {
      "Id": "entry-00006",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "You are still alive, so I assume the dragon is not. Or perhaps that assumption is premature. Either way, I need proof of the kill.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-on-quest-state",
              "Arguments": [
                "nar_great_arkanian_dragon",
                "2"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": [
            {
              "Key": "condition-on-quest-state",
              "Arguments": [
                "nar_great_arkanian_dragon",
                "1"
              ],
              "IsNegated": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00007": {
      "Id": "entry-00007",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Then this is concluded. The station can be marked hazardous but cleared of apex biological threat. You have done GSI, and quite a few future scavengers, a considerable service. Here is your payment. Next time I tell someone a dragon was nesting above Nar Shaddaa, perhaps they will stop laughing halfway through the sentence.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00010",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00008": {
      "Id": "entry-00008",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "Thanks for the help.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": []
    }
  },
